   "source_sha256": "eb0d5884569b398e475b89e77a068c6c575a0064ff6a72fafc173102c4cfcd57",
   "ko": "."
  },
  {
   "id": "da0506:T00006",
   "source_sha256": "75017edb1f097e0a7ad04aa0790d0ca09e9dc570bb9fc404e5f54185e6d806ae",
   "ko": "소용돌이에서는 무수한 촉수가, 사나운 송곳니가, 강산의 타액을 뚝뚝 흘리는\n혀가, "
  },
  {
   "id": "da0506:R00002",
   "source_sha256": "99b6e833260df6199d397adb4604f04546dfabaa5c0b2bb35e0521f3f3a5141d",
   "ko": "링가",
   "ruby_action": "keep"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0506:T00007",
   "source_sha256": "e6250c187e239709d724c06dfba31f4ffba63be18b544508ac75064f76e16d39",
   "ko": "양근"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0506:T00008",
   "source_sha256": "427566260604d16fb4a900e51400dd5dfac2ef749901179434735f0d0008d100",
   "ko": "과 "
  },
  {
   "id": "da0506:R00003",
